.TH "apk\-adbsign" "8" "2026\-08\-31"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
apk adbsign \- sign, resign or recompress apk v3 packages or indexes
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBapk adbsign\fR [<\fIoptions\fR>.\&.\&.\&] \fIfiles\fR.\&.\&.\&
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBapk adbsign\fR will process specified \fIfiles\fR and add or replace
the signatures in addition to recompressing it.\& The original compression
algorithm and level is used unless specified.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
See also \fBapk\fR(8) for additional package generation options.\&
.PP
\fB\-\-reset\-signatures\fR
.RS 4
Remove all existing signatures.\&
.RE
